Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.84,Hdr,,0,0,0,,March 9, 1996 - Hanshin Daishoten
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Narita Brian outside, Mayano Top Gun inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:06.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Side by side into the straight - a ferocious duel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:08.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Outside, the shadow-roll monster Narita Brian
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Inside, the ever-versatile Mayano Top Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:13.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,A two-horse match race past the 200 mark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:15.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,The third horse is a long way back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who leads - Narita Brian or Mayano Top Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.60,0:00:20.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,The match race goes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,In front, Narita Brian and Mayano Top Gun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:25.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Narita Brian and Mayano Top Gun - side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Narita Brian just on the outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:35.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Narita Brian - back to his best after a year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:39.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mayano Top Gun was magnificent in defeat - an incredible duel